    "description": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 396pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"528\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup><col style=\"mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 3218; width: 66pt;\" span=\"6\" width=\"88\"> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 15.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15.75pt; width: 396pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"528\" height=\"21\">Drop Items</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 15.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 15.75pt;\" height=\"21\">1~3</td>\n<td class=\"xl67\" colspan=\"5\">Drop money (10G)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-height-source: userset; height: 15.75pt;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 15.75pt;\" height=\"21\">4~6</td>\n<td class=\"xl67\" colspan=\"5\">Black-Bellied Fur [Valuable] (100G)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>▼Explanation<br>The Black Raccoon Tribe deceives people with illusions and deception, but depending on their skill,<br>There are also martial artists who toy with the enemy. Set yourself apart from others with your sharp eyes<br>The Harpoon Warrior of the Black Raccoon Tribe is a representative of such warriors.<br>Wearing only handmade harpoons and simple leather vests, they<br>With agile movements that seize the gap between the opponent and prevent the opponent from using their full strength.<br>He specializes in a fighting style that takes down opponents.<br>Although his physique and armament seem weak at first glance, don't be fooled.<br>That's their best strategy.<br>41</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
